                                "sense_id": "8f79e698-0291-391d-8b4f-00f8239636b1",
                                "text": "Leon Chevret, the French hotelkeeper, said of him to a lawyer of his acquaintance, \"Bret Harte, he have the Napoleonic nose, the nose of genius; also, like many of you professional men, his debts trouble him very little.\""
